From 97940e40a3951d024089459a63985ec3e9dd01f1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rob Durland <rob.durland@rentvision.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 08:32:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] MDFM 1.34.0: MIX files (export / import with crossmix)

A MIX FILE row in the MIX drawer: name a mix, EXPORT it to <name>.mdfm.json
(every station's What plays switches, instruments, sound, EQ, FX, ORIGINAL,
UNDERWATER, and each station's style, groove and BEAT; no skin or volume),
and IMPORT one back. While playing, the dials glide over CROSSMIX (0-15 s);
switches change halfway; a file from another station tunes there first.

New src/mixfile.js; engine getSettings / applySettings and the "mixfile"
event; radio-wire syncs the Settings lists. Tests: test/mixfile134.test.mjs
and a smoke-test import.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01T3mo4jUNbXvMiKwv8ETe52
